---
title: Support
description: Find help, troubleshooting guidance, and answers to common FOSSBilling questions.
---

Use this section when you are diagnosing a problem, checking current capabilities, or preparing useful information before asking the community for help.

If you are reporting a bug or asking for support, include your FOSSBilling version, PHP version, web server, database, relevant logs, and the steps needed to reproduce the problem.

